┌ Help ─ main view ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│ Everything flk runs on this host. Left: apps, with their machines (●         │
│ running, ○ stopped, ! should run but doesn't), volumes (▢) and forwarded     │
│ ports (⇄), then the host. Right: tabs for the selection. Bottom: what needs  │
│ attention, from flk context --all. Below Host: Storage, Podman and Services, │
│ the rest of what this host runs. Each tab shows the command that fills it,   │
│ and every action shows the command it runs before running it (L lists them   │
│ all).                                                                        │
│                                                                              │
│ ↑ ↓  k j           move in the tree                                          │
│ ← →                fold or unfold an app                                     │
│ tab  shift+tab     next or previous tab                                      │
│ 1 … 9              jump to a tab                                             │
│ pgup pgdn          scroll the tab (also ctrl+u ctrl+d)                       │
│ l                  follow logs: the machine, or all of the app's machines    │
│ enter  x           actions for the selection (start, stop, deploy, secrets,… │
│ s                  start or stop the selected machine                        │
│ c                  attach to the machine's console (detach: Ctrl-b d)        │
│ >                  type a line into the machine's console, and watch its lo… │
│ d                  deploy the selected app                                   │
│ … 7 more (↓)                                                                 │
├──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┤
│ ↑↓ scroll · any other key closes this help                                   │
